OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds searching for Noah Woods,
OL,4,A3, as police keep 'open mind' on
OL,5,Adisappearance
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice release CCTV showing Noah Woods,
OL,8,F3, about half an hour before he
OL,9,Fdisappeared from a playground in
OL,10,FSuffolk on Tuesday at about 15:00 BST
OL,12,FThe three-year-old, who is partially
OL,13,Fdeaf and non-verbal, was with a
OL,14,Frelative in Brantham before he went
OL,15,Fmissing. He is unlikely to respond to
OL,16,Fhis name being called, police say
OL,18,FIn a new statement, officers say there
OL,19,Fis "nothing to indicate anything
OL,20,Fsinister or any element of criminality
OL,21,Fhas taken place although we keep an
OL,22,Fopen mind as to the circumstances"
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
